; DECnet-Stop - stop dnetd (open links get a disconnect)
; Usage: Execute DECnet:S/DECnet-Stop
; dnetd STOP finds the running dnetd by its port, however it was started
Which >NIL: dnetd
If WARN
  Path DECnet:C ADD
EndIf
; add-ons first (DECnet-Term: LAT sessions, maintenance login)
If EXISTS DECnet:S/DECnet-Stop-Term
  Execute DECnet:S/DECnet-Stop-Term
EndIf
dnetd STOP
